se model stem before first punctuation/digit, from OLL Base Model when present. OLL complete table read: 4576 source rows. Full eligible production rows used.\"\n}\n{\n  \"candidate\": {\n    \"editable_paths\": [\n      \"program_0/src\"\n    ],\n    \"interface\": \"python_rpc_v1:handle\"\n  },\n  \"canonical_task\": {\n    \"path\": \"task.md\",\n    \"sha256\": \"4c10abc4174a1571188346a912fe8e964e9b391456731d553885fbbfa1b3333b\"\n  },\n  \"compute\": {\n    \"final\": {\n      \"accelerator\": \"cpu\",\n      \"accelerator_model\": \"none\",\n      \"candidate_gpu_count\": 0,\n      \"cpu_cores\": 4,\n      \"evaluator_gpu_count\": 0,\n      \"gpu_count\": 0,\n      \"max_candidate_rpc_calls\": 2033,\n      \"memory_gb\": 16,\n      \"precision\": \"float64; little-endian float64 values and uint8 masks in base64 inline chunks\",\n      \"wall_clock_seconds\": 3600\n    },\n    \"search\": {\n      \"accelerator\": \"cpu\",\n      \"accelerator_model\": \"none\",\n      \"candidate_gpu_count\": 0,\n      \"cpu_cores\": 4,\n      \"evaluator_gpu_count\": 0,\n      \"gpu_count\": 0,\n      \"max_candidate_rpc_calls\": 1733,\n      \"memory_gb\": 16,\n      \"precision\": \"float64; little-endian float64 values and uint8 masks in base64 inline chunks\",\n      \"wall_clock_seconds\": 1800\n    }\n  },\n  \"data\": {\n    \"final_roles\": [\n      \"sealed_history_queries_targets\",\n      \"sealed_controls_and_splits\"\n    ],\n    \"search_roles\": [\n      \"search_history_queries_targets\",\n      \"search_controls_and_splits\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"evaluators\": {\n    \"final\": \"evaluate_final.py\",\n    \"search\": \"evaluate.py\"\n  },\n  \"feedback\": {\n    \"final_sealed\": [\n      \"Final resources, seeds, row provenance, targets, baseline outputs, metrics, diagnostics and bootstraps stay private until candidate freeze and final completion.\",\n      \"Only legitimate current final episode history, availability and purchased scores reach frozen candidate. 