ed smoke is compatibility only, not production qualification or candidate-ranking evidence.\",\n        \"preserves\": \"All four cases and both conditions, real-source loading, exact API, full k checkpoints, five baselines, nonvacuous input control, replay, fixed metric paths and CPU topology.\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"search_reset_sequence\": [\n      17,\n      29,\n      43,\n      17,\n      29,\n      43,\n      17,\n      29,\n      43,\n      17,\n      29,\n      43,\n      17,\n      29,\n      43,\n      17,\n      29,\n      43,\n      17,\n      29,\n      43,\n      17,\n      29,\n      43,\n      17\n    ],\n    \"search_seeds\": [\n      17,\n      29,\n      43\n    ],\n    \"search_smoke_reset_sequence\": [\n      17,\n      17,\n      17,\n      17,\n      17,\n      17,\n      17,\n      17,\n      17\n    ]\n  },\n  \"provenance\": {\n    \"artifacts\": [\n      {\n        \"path\": \"resources/search/audit.json\",\n        \"role\": \"search_frozen_score_resources\",\n        \"sha256\": \"3c306e511a3b35992383120c577f369f3b29277e3c06279da99e51f6168b9e66\",\n        \"source\": \"Pinned leaderboard extraction and evaluator-owned preregistration; source URLs, revisions, document/row provenance and acquisition hashes in resources/search/audit.json. No synthetic scored examples.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"resources/search/plan.json\",\n        \"role\": \"search_frozen_score_resources\",\n        \"sha256\": \"35b3a4dfed267be26c720a2dbee12325d9a7edf84d9c0cd7bd5492a3417f7301\",\n        \"source\": \"Pinned leaderboard extraction and evaluator-owned preregistration; source URLs, revisions, document/row provenance and acquisition hashes in resources/search/audit.json. No synthetic scored examples.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"resources/search/pool.json.gz\",\n        \"role\": \"search_frozen_score_resources\",\n        \"sha256\": \"32320163b3c983c6bec9c02404f2d4c5774bed85c818c372dea6df42b6595b8f\",\n        \"source\": 