on uses all eligible rows of pinned real sources, not synthetic stand-ins. CPython 3.12.15 Linux x86_64 validated; compatible Python>=3.11, no GPU or paid API. Native Landlock ABI>=1 and seccomp mandatory; 1 evaluator BLAS thread and up to3 candidate threads. No canonical minimum productive-baseline time is specified. Full score/operation-count tables, priors, fixed penalties and limitations are frozen in each resource plan.json. Largest declared complete request and response measured including base64, metadata, newline and 4096-byte extra envelope reserve. No state telemetry or mechanism claims from self-reports.\"\n  }\n}\n25\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
